abstract: >-
  Audit tooling and frozen-prediction artifacts for measuring medical
  vision-language models: a CPU-only command-line audit of prediction-file
  denominators, response collapse under image shifts, and selective-prediction
  baselines, together with the source of two manuscripts and the protocols that
  produced them.
